folio8-list">      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">        <div class="ezy__portfolio8-item mt-4">          <div class="ezy__portfolio8-banner px-4 pt-4 px-lg-5 pt-lg-5">            <img              src="assets/img/education/open (20).jpg"              alt=""              class="img-fluid w-100"            />          </div>          <div class="ezy__portfolio8-content p-4 p-lg-5">            <h4 class="mb-3"> The School-Parent Partnership: A Collaborative Journey</h4>            <p class="opacity-50 mb-0">              We believe a child’s growth thrives on strong school-parent partnerships. With transparent admissions, open communication, and continuous collaboration, we create a supportive network that nurtures confidence, motivation, and academic success.            </p>                  </div>        </div>      </div>      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">        <div class="ezy__portfolio8-item active mt-4">          <div class="ezy__portfolio8-banner px-4 pt-4 px-lg-5 pt-lg-5">            <img              src="assets/img/education/open (11).jpg"              alt=""              class="img-fluid w-100"            />          </div>          <div class="ezy__portfolio8-content p-4 p-lg-5">            <h4 class="mb-3">Assessment for Growth: Supporting, Not Just Evaluating</h4>            <p class="opacity-50 mb-0">              Our philosophy emphasizes assessments that support learning rather than just measure it. In admissions too, we look beyond scores to understand each child’s potential, interests, and learning style, ensuring every learning journey is nurtured.            </p>                  </div>        </div>      </div>      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">        <div class="ezy__portfolio8-item mt-4">          <div class="ezy__portfolio8-banner px-4 pt-4 px-lg-5 pt-lg-5">            <img              src="assets/img/kids - Edited.png"              alt=""              class="img-fluid w-100"            />          </div>          <div class="ezy__por